invalid type: string "## Strategic LinkedIn Networking & Cold Outreach Guide\n\n### Target Identification and Research\nBefore reaching out to industry professionals on LinkedIn, research their profile, recent posts, and shared connections. Prioritize company alumni, mutual contacts, or practitioners working in your specific area of interest (e.g., Software Engineering, Data Science).\n\nÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ